# from (e4, e5): w_k = (e_a + e_b)/2, w'_k = (e_a - e_b)/2 for k = 0, 1 and w_2 = (e4 + i e5)/2,
# w'_2 = (-e4 + i e5)/2, so <w_j, w'_k> = delta_jk / 2.  The paper's isotropic basis (pairing
